ck on areas you could further improve.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"technical-blogs">Technical Blogs</h2>
<p>Do you know what percentage of candidates write technical blogs? Only a =
fraction of all resumes I=E2=80=99ve seen. So if you happen to write one, y=
ou=E2=80=99ll already have something to stand out with=E2=80=94assuming you=
 add it to your resume. However, don=E2=80=99t <em>just</em> add your techn=
ical blog to your resume. Similar to your GitHub, be deliberate about what =
the one or two articles you=E2=80=99d want a hiring manager to read.</p>
<hr>
